## Why This Is Asked
Tests handling of a dynamic, reconfigurable sensor array with multi-speaker segregation under strict latency. It also probes adaptive model order, cross-bin permutation, and pragmatic evaluation.

## Key Concepts
- Convolutive ICA, joint diagonalization, adaptive demixer sizing
- Dynamic model-order selection, cross-bin tracking
- Real-time constraints, evaluation metrics SDR/SIR, latency

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode: update loop
while (streaming) {
  const X = STFT(frame);
  whiten = whiten(X);
  const W = ICA(whiten, k=4, adaptive=true);
  const Y = W @ whiten;
  publish(Y);
}
```

